WEBVTT

00:00.674 --> 00:03.674
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:03.674 --> 00:10.507
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:10.507 --> 00:13.674
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

00:13.674 --> 00:15.040
[laughing]
[笑]

00:15.040 --> 00:17.340
- And how was
your meal today, ma'am?
- 怎么样？
女士，今天吃饭吗？

00:17.340 --> 00:18.774
- Oh, delicious.
- 哦，好吃。

00:18.774 --> 00:20.874
I wish I could tell everyone
我希望我能告诉大家

00:20.874 --> 00:23.107
how great my meal was.
我的饭菜多么美味啊。

00:23.107 --> 00:26.074
- Well, you're more then welcome
to go to each table
- 好吧，非常欢迎你
去每张桌子

00:26.074 --> 00:28.840
and tell 'em about
your satisfactory experience.
并告诉他们
您满意的体验。

00:28.840 --> 00:30.974
- I don't really have time
to do that.
-我真的没有时间
这样做。

00:30.974 --> 00:33.874
Perhaps I will mention it
in my will.
也许我会提到它
在我的意愿中。

00:33.874 --> 00:35.407
- Well, if that's the way
you want it.
- 好吧，如果是这样的话
你想要它。

00:35.407 --> 00:37.207
- Wait!
I have an idea.
- 等待！
我有一个主意。

00:37.207 --> 00:40.174
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

00:40.174 --> 00:42.774
- Hold on a second.
That's me corkboard.
- 等一下。
那是我的软木板。

00:42.774 --> 00:44.607
It's for all me...
这是为了我所有人...

00:44.607 --> 00:45.607
memos.
备忘录。

00:45.607 --> 00:46.974
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

00:46.974 --> 00:49.240
- Mr. Krabs,
think of it now as...
- 蟹老板先生，
现在把它想成...

00:49.240 --> 00:52.107
a bulletin board
for the community,
布告栏
为社会，

00:52.107 --> 00:53.840
a place where
a yearning populace
一个地方
向往的民众

00:53.840 --> 00:56.307
can express themselves freely.
可以自由地表达自己。

00:56.307 --> 00:59.107
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

00:59.107 --> 01:02.307
[upbeat instrumental music]
[欢快的器乐]

01:02.307 --> 01:08.607
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:08.607 --> 01:09.774
Hmm.
唔。

01:09.774 --> 01:10.974
Well, I was just gonna loiter,
嗯，我只是想闲逛，

01:10.974 --> 01:13.140
but now I think I'll get
a Krabby Patty.
但现在我想我会得到
蟹肉饼。

01:13.140 --> 01:14.607
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:14.607 --> 01:16.607
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

01:16.607 --> 01:17.774
- Hey, everybody,
- 嘿，大家，

01:17.774 --> 01:20.207
a community bulletin board
is here.
社区公告板
在这里。

01:20.207 --> 01:22.507
Tell your friends
to come on down and use it
告诉你的朋友
下来使用它

01:22.507 --> 01:24.540
for the good of me business--
me wallet--
为了我的生意好——
我的钱包——

01:24.540 --> 01:25.540
[stammering]
[结巴]

01:25.540 --> 01:26.840
I mean, the community.
我的意思是，社区。

01:26.840 --> 01:28.607
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:28.607 --> 01:31.774
[indistinct conversation]
[含糊不清的对话]

01:31.774 --> 01:32.874
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

01:32.874 --> 01:34.574
Community.
社区。

01:34.574 --> 01:42.774
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:45.340 --> 01:48.540
- Oh, I really hope
people like it.
- 哦，我真的希望
人们喜欢它。

01:48.540 --> 01:52.474
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:52.474 --> 01:54.240
- Number one with a star.
- 带星星的第一名。

01:54.240 --> 01:57.340
- [laughing]
- [笑]

01:57.340 --> 01:58.474
[wheel squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

01:58.474 --> 01:59.774
- See, Mr. Krabs?
- 看到了吗，蟹老板？

01:59.774 --> 02:01.774
The community bulletin board
is a good thing.
社区公告栏
是一件好事。

02:01.774 --> 02:03.474
- Yes.
Yes, it is.
- 是的。
是的。

02:03.474 --> 02:06.040
It's bringing me closer
to my favorite part
它让我更接近
到我最喜欢的部分

02:06.040 --> 02:08.440
of the community: their money.
社区的：他们的钱。

02:08.440 --> 02:11.640
- Let's see what other
nice people are saying.
- 让我们看看还有什么
好人说。

02:11.640 --> 02:14.040
[screaming]
[尖叫]

02:14.040 --> 02:16.407
- What are you shrieking about?
- 你在尖叫什么？

02:16.407 --> 02:18.207
- Nothing.
I just love to shriek.
- 没有什么。
我就是喜欢尖叫。

02:18.207 --> 02:20.540
[shrieking]
[尖叫]

02:20.540 --> 02:22.540
- Step aside, boy,
you're blocking
- 靠边站，孩子，
你正在阻止

02:22.540 --> 02:24.607
me moneymaking bulletin board.
我赚钱的公告板。

02:24.607 --> 02:26.374
[creaking]
[吱吱作响]

02:26.374 --> 02:28.440
- "When I eat
at the Krusty Krab..."
-“当我吃饭的时候
在蟹堡王……”

02:34.507 --> 02:35.840
Ouch.
哎哟。

02:35.840 --> 02:36.874
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

02:36.874 --> 02:37.974
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:37.974 --> 02:40.240
Hey, not on my bulletin board.
嘿，不在我的公告板上。

02:40.240 --> 02:42.540
- Whoa, whoa, dude,
what's with the censorship?
- 哇哦，哇哦，伙计，
审查制度怎么了？

02:42.540 --> 02:45.174
The community bulletin board
is for everybody.
社区公告栏
适合所有人。

02:45.174 --> 02:46.674
You can't just
take something down
你不能只是
把东西拿下来

02:46.674 --> 02:48.307
because you think it's bogus.
因为你认为它是假的。

02:48.307 --> 02:50.140
- Mr. Krabs,
Surfer Fish is right.
- 蟹老板先生，
冲浪者鱼是对的。

02:50.140 --> 02:54.440
The board is sacred,
and it must be respected.
董事会是神圣的，
并且它必须受到尊重。

02:54.440 --> 02:57.107
"Dear P-Star7,
I'm so sorry you had
“亲爱的 P-Star7，
我很抱歉你有

02:57.107 --> 02:59.307
"a less than stellar experience
at the Krusty Krab,
“一次不太好的体验
在蟹堡王店，

02:59.307 --> 03:01.407
"and we promise
to do better in future.
“我们保证
以便将来做得更好。

03:01.407 --> 03:03.940
Signed, Fry-Banshee139."
签名，Fry-Banshee139。”

03:03.940 --> 03:07.274
Ha.
Crisis averted.
哈。
危机得以避免。

03:07.274 --> 03:08.207
Huh?
啊？

03:11.774 --> 03:13.507
"Signed, GuyBesideU3."
“签名，GuyBesideU3。”

03:13.507 --> 03:16.240
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

03:16.240 --> 03:17.040
- Huh?
- 啊？

03:17.040 --> 03:18.774
"Dumb-blurted, LOL?"
“哑口无言，哈哈？”

03:18.774 --> 03:20.040
"What's the point?"
“有什么意义？”

03:20.040 --> 03:22.507
"I could make a better patty
out of mud"?
“我可以做出更好的肉饼
从泥里出来”？

03:22.507 --> 03:24.674
Where are all these notes
coming from?
这些笔记都在哪里
来自？

03:24.674 --> 03:26.407
- Pencils, paper.
- 铅笔、纸。

03:26.407 --> 03:28.207
Pencils, paper.
铅笔、纸。

03:28.207 --> 03:31.307
- I want to express
the worst side of myself.
- 我想表达
我自己最糟糕的一面。

03:31.307 --> 03:32.307
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

03:32.307 --> 03:33.507
Why not?
为什么不呢？

03:33.507 --> 03:35.774
And don't forget
to feed your hatred
并且不要忘记
来满足你的仇恨

03:35.774 --> 03:38.507
with a selection
from our menu.
有选择
从我们的菜单中。

03:38.507 --> 03:40.007
- Huh?
Oh.
- 啊？
哦。

03:40.007 --> 03:45.140
- If only I could figure out
who this P-Star7 is.
- 如果我能弄清楚就好了
这个P-Star7是谁。

03:45.140 --> 03:46.574
- Hello.
- 你好。

03:46.574 --> 03:48.974
[indistinct conversation]
[含糊不清的对话]

03:48.974 --> 03:50.907
- P-Star7 is my new hero.
- P-Star7 是我的新英雄。

03:50.907 --> 03:51.940
- Hey, that's me.
- 嘿，那是我。

03:51.940 --> 03:53.107
- Yeah, right.
- 是的，对。

03:53.107 --> 03:55.807
- He really knows
how to complain.
- 他真的知道
如何投诉。

03:55.807 --> 03:58.107
- But I wasn't com--
- 但我没能——

03:58.107 --> 04:01.774
- P-Star7 is cool
because he's anonymous.
- P-Star7 很酷
因为他是匿名的。

04:01.774 --> 04:03.140
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

04:03.140 --> 04:06.940
He's cool
because he's a nanny mouse.
他很酷
因为他是一只老鼠保姆。

04:06.940 --> 04:10.407
- You may not like
what P-Star7 has to say,
- 你可能不喜欢
P-Star7 必须说的话

04:10.407 --> 04:13.174
but you have to agree
that he keeps it real.
但你必须同意
他保持真实。

04:13.174 --> 04:16.540
He's a true hero
for our troubled times.
他是一个真正的英雄
为了我们的困难时期。

04:16.540 --> 04:19.240
- Well, I'll just have
to make my Krabby Patties better
- 好吧，我就拥有
让我的蟹黄饼变得更好

04:19.240 --> 04:21.607
so P-Star7 will like 'em.
所以 P-Star7 会喜欢他们的。

04:21.607 --> 04:24.540
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

04:24.540 --> 04:25.774
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

04:25.774 --> 04:27.274
[grill sizzling]
[烧烤滋滋作响]

04:27.274 --> 04:29.507
No, it's not round enough.
不，它不够圆。

04:29.507 --> 04:31.607
Maybe just a little
off the edge here.
也许只是一点点
离开这里的边缘。

04:31.607 --> 04:34.207
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

04:34.207 --> 04:36.207
No, now the other side
is wobbly.
不，现在另一边
摇摇欲坠。

04:36.207 --> 04:38.274
I'll just even it up
a little here.
我会把它弄平
这里有一点。

04:38.274 --> 04:41.140
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

04:41.140 --> 04:44.440
Now it's smaller than that one.
现在比那个小了。

04:44.440 --> 04:46.574
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:46.574 --> 04:47.574
Oh.
哦。

04:47.574 --> 04:49.074
Hey, Squidward.
- Yes?
嘿，章鱼哥。
- 是的？

04:49.074 --> 04:51.774
- Has P-Star7 responded
to my nice note yet?
- P-Star7 回复了吗
我的好便条还没收到吗？

04:51.774 --> 04:54.040
- Oh, he responded hours ago.
- 哦，他几个小时前就回复了。

04:54.040 --> 04:56.540
- Why didn't you tell me?
- 你为什么不告诉我？

04:56.540 --> 04:58.607
- Because I don't care?
- 因为我不在乎？

04:58.607 --> 05:01.540
[crowd murmuring]
[人群窃窃私语]

05:02.840 --> 05:03.974
- That's for me.
- 那是给我的。

05:10.374 --> 05:12.274
- His vituperative hyperbole
- 他的谩骂式的夸张

05:12.274 --> 05:15.440
has certainly diminished
your credibility.
确实减少了
你的信誉。

05:15.440 --> 05:17.207
- Oh, why did you
have to say that?
- 哦，你为什么
必须这么说吗？

05:17.207 --> 05:18.874
- You're right.
- 你说得对。

05:18.874 --> 05:23.674
I should have put it
on the bulletin board instead.
我应该把它
而是在公告板上。

05:23.674 --> 05:26.474
"Signed, HandsomeLad42."
“签名，帅哥42号。”

05:26.474 --> 05:29.607
- You may be handsome,
HandsomeLad42,
- 你可能很帅，
帅哥42，

05:29.607 --> 05:30.907
but you're very mean.
但你很刻薄。

05:30.907 --> 05:33.207
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

05:33.207 --> 05:35.674
- Yeah, that's a good one, yeah.
- 是的，这是一件好事，是的。

05:35.674 --> 05:36.974
You know, all this note-writing
你知道，所有这些笔记

05:36.974 --> 05:39.040
must be making you folks hungry.
一定让你们饿了。

05:39.040 --> 05:41.640
We have a short line
at the register.
我们有一条短线
在登记处。

05:41.640 --> 05:43.607
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

05:43.607 --> 05:44.940
- I brought a bag lunch.
- 我带了袋午餐。

05:44.940 --> 05:46.974
- [stammering]
Wait a second.
- [结巴]
等一下。

05:46.974 --> 05:48.640
None of you
bulletin-board browsers
你们都没有
公告板浏览器

05:48.640 --> 05:49.907
are buying me patties?
给我买肉饼吗？

05:49.907 --> 05:51.907
- Why would we buy food
from a place
- 我们为什么要买食物
从一个地方

05:51.907 --> 05:54.440
that "smells like
stinky armpits"?
那个“闻起来像
腋窝臭”？

05:54.440 --> 05:55.440
- What?
- 什么？

05:55.440 --> 05:58.507
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

05:58.507 --> 05:59.907
That's not true.
那不是真的。

05:59.907 --> 06:01.107
- Hey, it's on the board.
- 嘿，它在黑板上。

06:01.107 --> 06:03.140
- And the board is never wrong.
- 董事会永远不会错。

06:03.140 --> 06:05.774
- Does anyone need to buy a pen?
- 有人需要买钢笔吗？

06:05.774 --> 06:07.774
How about some paper?
来点纸怎么样？

06:07.774 --> 06:09.407
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:09.407 --> 06:10.774
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

06:10.774 --> 06:11.774
- What's wrong?
- 怎么了？

06:11.774 --> 06:13.307
- It's this P-Star7.
- 这是P-Star7。

06:13.307 --> 06:15.040
He's been saying
terrible things about me
他一直在说
关于我的可怕的事情

06:15.040 --> 06:16.507
and the Krusty Krab.
和蟹堡王。

06:16.507 --> 06:18.807
- Oh, I think they were
all good things.
- 哦，我想他们是
所有美好的事物。

06:18.807 --> 06:19.774
- Not good.
- 不好。

06:19.774 --> 06:21.074
He said the Krusty Krab
他说蟹堡王

06:21.074 --> 06:23.074
made him feel
dark and empty inside.
让他感觉
里面又黑又空。

06:23.074 --> 06:24.907
- Well, he probably meant
- 嗯，他可能是说

06:24.907 --> 06:27.007
his stomach was dark and empty,
他的胃又黑又空，

06:27.007 --> 06:29.040
and he was hungry for more.
他还渴望更多。

06:29.040 --> 06:31.574
- No, a master of acid wit
like P-Star7
- 不，是一位尖刻的机智大师
像P-Star7

06:31.574 --> 06:33.907
would never express himself
so clumsily.
永远不会表达自己
如此笨拙。

06:33.907 --> 06:36.907
He called me Cry-Baby139.
他叫我Cry-Baby139。

06:36.907 --> 06:38.807
- You were Fry-Banshee?
- 你是弗莱女妖？

06:38.807 --> 06:39.807
- Yeah.
- 是的。

06:39.807 --> 06:42.074
- Well, maybe he just thought
- 好吧，也许他只是想

06:42.074 --> 06:43.540
it was funny,
很有趣，

06:43.540 --> 06:46.040
and--and when he said
that Krabby Patties
然后——当他说
那个蟹肉饼

06:46.040 --> 06:48.140
taste like old baseball gloves--
尝起来像旧棒球手套——

06:48.140 --> 06:49.140
- He said that?
- 他这么说的？

06:49.140 --> 06:50.874
- Oh, not yet.
- 哦，还没有。

06:50.874 --> 06:52.007
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:52.007 --> 06:53.207
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

06:53.207 --> 06:55.774
Taste like old baseball gloves,
do they?
味道像旧棒球手套，
他们吗？

06:55.774 --> 06:57.774
- [laughing]
- [笑]

06:57.774 --> 07:00.774
I don't know
who this P-Star7 is,
我不知道
这个P-Star7是谁，

07:00.774 --> 07:02.107
but he's brilliant.
但他很聪明。

07:02.107 --> 07:04.807
- He's a diabolical genius,
that's what he is.
- 他是一个恶魔般的天才
他就是这样。

07:04.807 --> 07:07.774
- [murmuring]
- [低语]

07:10.240 --> 07:12.807
- Mr. Krabs,
the grill's gone cold.
- 蟹老板先生，
烤架变冷了。

07:12.807 --> 07:14.374
- Nobody's ordering, son.
- 没有人点菜，孩子。

07:14.374 --> 07:16.674
It's that cursed corkboard.
就是那个该死的软木板。

07:16.674 --> 07:18.974
I'm gonna take it down.
It's nothing but trouble.
我要把它拿下来。
没什么，就是麻烦。

07:18.974 --> 07:21.040
- You can't, Mr. Krabs.
It's for the community.
- 你不能，蟹老板。
这是为了社区。

07:21.040 --> 07:24.874
I still believe in the power
of the bulletin board.
我仍然相信力量
的公告板。

07:24.874 --> 07:26.840
[crowd laughing]
[人群大笑]

07:26.840 --> 07:28.240
- "You smell."
- “你闻起来。”

07:28.240 --> 07:29.340
[crowd laughing]
[人群大笑]

07:29.340 --> 07:31.874
- "One of your eyes is too big."
- “你的一只眼睛太大了。”

07:31.874 --> 07:33.407
[crowd laughing]
[人群大笑]

07:33.407 --> 07:36.074
- "Close your mouth
when you eat."
-“闭上你的嘴
当你吃饭的时候。”

07:36.074 --> 07:37.074
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

07:37.074 --> 07:38.307
Oh.
哦。

07:38.307 --> 07:40.340
- Oh, "This picture looks like
- 哦，“这张照片看起来像

07:40.340 --> 07:42.840
it was drawn by a brine shrimp!"
是丰年虾拉来的！”

07:42.840 --> 07:44.807
[crying]
Oh, Daddy.
[哭泣]
哦，爸爸。

07:44.807 --> 07:46.140
- [laughing]
- [笑]

07:46.140 --> 07:47.140
Huh?
啊？

07:47.140 --> 07:48.140
"Squidward Tentacles
“章鱼哥的触手

07:48.140 --> 07:49.307
"should never be allowed
“永远不应该允许

07:49.307 --> 07:51.040
"behind a cash register.
“在收银机后面。

07:51.040 --> 07:52.174
P-Star7."
P-Star7。”
P-Star7。”
P-Star7。”
P-Star7。”
P-Star7。”
P-Star7。”
P-Star7。”

07:52.174 --> 07:54.007
Oh, that is it.
哦，就是这样。

07:54.007 --> 07:55.774
Why can't any of these yokels
为什么这些乡巴佬不能

07:55.774 --> 07:59.207
understand I'm working here
ironically?
了解我在这里工作
讽刺的是？

07:59.207 --> 08:01.040
- Oh, sure you are.
- 哦，当然是。

08:01.040 --> 08:04.540
P-Star7 has your number,
all right.
P-Star7 有你的电话号码，
好吧。

08:04.540 --> 08:06.140
- I'm gonna give you
a number...
- 我会给你
一个数字...

08:06.140 --> 08:07.607
of contusions!
挫伤！

08:07.607 --> 08:09.507
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

08:09.507 --> 08:12.140
- People, can't you see
what's happened?
- 各位，你们难道看不出来吗？
发生了什么事？

08:12.140 --> 08:13.840
This bulletin board has become
该公告栏已成为

08:13.840 --> 08:15.640
a bullying board.
欺凌委员会。

08:15.640 --> 08:17.307
[crowd murmuring]
[人群窃窃私语]

08:17.307 --> 08:19.840
- Okay that's it.
- 好吧，就是这样。

08:19.840 --> 08:21.374
Everybody out.
大家都出去吧。

08:21.374 --> 08:23.040
- I can't believe
we're being kicked out again.
- 我不敢相信
我们又被赶出去了。

08:23.040 --> 08:24.240
Let's go to my house.
我们去我家吧。

08:24.240 --> 08:27.307
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:27.307 --> 08:30.240
- Oh, P-Star7 is bringing out
the worst in everybody.
- 哦，P-Star7 即将推出
每个人中最糟糕的。

08:30.240 --> 08:31.840
I'd like to send him a message.
我想给他发消息。

08:31.840 --> 08:34.140
- We'll teach him a lesson
he'll never forget.
- 我们会教训他的
他永远不会忘记。

08:34.140 --> 08:36.074
- A lesson in polite manners.
- 礼貌礼仪课程。

08:36.074 --> 08:37.407
- Or we could push him
off a cliff.
- 或者我们可以推他
掉下悬崖。

08:37.407 --> 08:39.640
- Ooh, excellent option,
Mr. Squidward.
- 哦，很棒的选择，
章鱼哥先生。

08:39.640 --> 08:42.340
- We have to find out
who this P-Star7 is.
-我们必须找出答案
这个P-Star7是谁。

08:42.340 --> 08:45.907
Gentlemen, I propose
a stakeout.
先生们，我提议
监视。

08:45.907 --> 08:47.307
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

08:47.307 --> 08:49.140
Pineapple One to Mad Daddy.
菠萝一号给疯爸爸。

08:49.140 --> 08:50.540
Come in, Mad Daddy.
进来吧，疯狂的爸爸。

08:50.540 --> 08:51.340
[static]
[静止的]

08:51.340 --> 08:52.840
- This is Mad Daddy.
- 这是疯爸爸。

08:52.840 --> 08:54.840
I read you, Pineapple One.
我读到你了，菠萝一号。

08:54.840 --> 08:55.974
Any movement?
有什么动静吗？

08:55.974 --> 08:57.107
[static]
[静止的]

08:57.107 --> 08:58.107
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

08:58.107 --> 08:59.340
- Negatory.
- 否定。

08:59.340 --> 09:00.840
Pineapple One
to Delicate Flower.
菠萝一号
到娇嫩的花。

09:00.840 --> 09:02.440
Come in, Delicate Flower.
进来吧，娇花。

09:02.440 --> 09:06.574
- I am not answering
to Delicate Flower!
- 我不回答
致娇花！

09:06.574 --> 09:08.974
[soft instrumental music]
[轻柔的器乐]

09:08.974 --> 09:10.540
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:10.540 --> 09:13.374
- Shh.
Maintain radio silence.
- 嘘。
保持无线电静默。

09:13.374 --> 09:15.407
Wait a minute.
I see something.
等一下。
我看到一些东西。

09:15.407 --> 09:18.607
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

09:18.607 --> 09:20.240
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:20.240 --> 09:21.974
- Ooh.
- 哦。

09:21.974 --> 09:23.474
[slurping]
[发出声音]

09:23.474 --> 09:25.874
- So that's what happens
to the ketchup stains.
- 所以这就是发生的事情
番茄酱污渍。

09:25.874 --> 09:29.507
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:29.507 --> 09:32.207
- Surprise, P-Star7!
- 惊喜，P-Star7！

09:32.207 --> 09:34.174
all: Patrick?
所有人：帕特里克？

09:34.174 --> 09:36.174
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

09:36.174 --> 09:39.174
I'll tear you to pieces.
我会把你撕成碎片。

09:39.174 --> 09:42.174
[growling]
[咆哮]

09:42.174 --> 09:45.174
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:45.174 --> 09:46.274
[munching]
[咀嚼]

09:46.274 --> 09:49.274
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:49.274 --> 09:52.040
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

09:52.040 --> 09:55.040
[machinery whirring]
[机器的呼呼声]

09:55.040 --> 09:57.574
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:57.574 --> 09:58.574
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:58.574 --> 09:59.374
- Patrick.
- 帕特里克.

09:59.374 --> 10:00.907
You're P-Star7?
你是P-Star7吗？

10:00.907 --> 10:05.174
- Well, that's what my last note
was about, SpongeBob.
- 嗯，这就是我最后的笔记
是关于海绵宝宝。

10:05.174 --> 10:08.007
I was upset that people
take everything I say
我很沮丧人们
接受我所说的一切

10:08.007 --> 10:09.874
the wrong way.
错误的方式。

10:09.874 --> 10:11.507
- So when you said
that Krabby Patties
- 所以当你说
那个蟹肉饼

10:11.507 --> 10:12.940
reminded you
of old baseball gloves,
提醒你了
旧棒球手套，

10:12.940 --> 10:15.007
you really meant
that they gave you the feeling
你的意思是
他们给你的感觉

10:15.007 --> 10:16.440
of your carefree youth.
属于你无忧无虑的青春。

10:16.440 --> 10:18.107
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

10:18.107 --> 10:19.840
Yeah, I think.
是的，我想。

10:19.840 --> 10:21.174
- You hear that, Boardy?
- 你听到了吗，博迪？

10:21.174 --> 10:23.440
It wasn't you.
It was never you.
不是你。
从来都不是你。

10:23.440 --> 10:26.007
We were the monsters all along.
我们一直都是怪物。

10:26.007 --> 10:27.540
- Well, I'm still angry!
- 好吧，我还是很生气！

10:27.540 --> 10:30.007
And I need something
to calm me down.
我需要一些东西
让我平静下来。

10:30.007 --> 10:33.107
Ooh, this knitting circle
ought to do the trick.
哦，这个编织圈
应该可以解决问题。

10:33.107 --> 10:35.007
And you all are joining me.
你们都加入了我。

10:35.007 --> 10:39.007
Especially you, Delicate Flower.
尤其是你，娇花。

10:39.007 --> 10:41.240
- Oh, ratfish.
- 哦，鼠鱼。

10:42.207 --> 10:43.940
- Pineapple One to Knit Mama.
- 给妈妈编织的菠萝一号。

10:43.940 --> 10:46.374
Can I needle you
for a little more yarn?
我可以给你打针吗
多一点纱线吗？

10:46.374 --> 10:47.374
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

10:47.374 --> 10:49.207
- Oh, brother.
- 哦，兄弟。

10:49.207 --> 10:52.874
Please bring back P-Star7.
请带回P-Star7。

10:52.874 --> 10:55.807
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

[全都笑了]